OL,3,A'Anger in the streets': Tens of
OL,4,Athousands protest in Spain over housing
OL,5,Acrisis
OL,6,
OL,7,FThousands of protesters have taken to
OL,8,Fthe streets across Spain calling for
OL,9,Fgreater protections for tenants after
OL,10,Fthe government failed to pass emergency
OL,11,Fhousing legislation in parliament on
OL,12,FFriday.
OL,14,FAbout 50 marches took place on Saturday
OL,15,Fin cities including Madrid, Valencia
OL,16,Fand Barcelona.
OL,18,F"There is a lot of anger in the
OL,19,Fstreets," a spokesperson for the
OL,20,FValencia Tenants' Union said. Clashes
OL,21,Ftook have taken place between some
OL,22,Fprotesters and police in the city.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
